==English==
===Etymology===
Greek arthro-, [[joint]] + [[-itis]], [[inflammation]]

===Noun===
'''arthritis''' (''plural'' '''arthritides''')

# {{pathology}} [[Inflammation]] of a [[joint]] or joints causing [[pain]] and/or [[disabliity]] , swelling and stiffness, and due to various causes such as [[infection]], [[trauma]], degenerative changes or [[metabolic]] disorders.  
